# Local working notes, deliberately not published.
#
# PROJECT_CONTEXT.md is a session-handoff document: a snapshot taken by
# reading the tree at one commit, so it starts going stale the moment the
# next commit lands. CLAUDE.md is the maintained version of the same ground
# and is the one that ships.
#
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. The snapshot carries internal working detail —
# which GitHub account pushes, how production is deployed, the private
# design-system dependency. None of it is secret and CLAUDE.md already says
# as much, but "already exposed" is a poor reason to publish eighty-six more
# kilobytes of it.
PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
